{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48396","headline":"判道士黄山隐 · 皇甫大夫","name":"判道士黄山隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道士黄山隐，轻人复重财。\n太山将比甑，东海只容杯。\n绿绶藏云帔，乌巾换鹿胎。\n黄泉六个鬼，今夜待君来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫大夫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}